     [DW_DLE_ARGUMENT]  One of the arguments _c_u___d_i_e___o_f_f_s_e_t, _c_u___o_f_f_s_e_t, _d_b_g,
                        _d_i_e___o_f_f_s_e_t, _t_y_p_e, _t_y_p_e_s, _n_a_m_e, or _n_t_y_p_e_s was NULL.

     [DW_DLE_NO_ENTRY]  The DWARF debugging context referenced by argument _d_b_g
                        did not contain information about user-defined types.

